--- !u!114 &767681851554003319
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7408256546194580001}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ac98efaeff4b83c48a626ae5b22d32f8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableItem
  _promptMessage: Press [E] to Read
  _content: "<align=center><b><b><size=110%>SURVIVAL GUIDE</size></b></align>\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>MOVEMENT
    & STAMINA</b></color>\r\n\u2022 <b>Running:</b> Hold <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Shift]</color></b>
    to sprint. This drains your <b><color=green>Stamina</color></b>. If it hits zero,
    you become <b><color=red>Exhausted</color></b>\u2014moving slowly until you recover.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Crouching:</b> Press <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Ctrl]</color></b> to toggle. Crouching
    makes you <b>Silent</b> and significantly reduces the <b>Monster's Vision</b>.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>INVENTORY
    & INTERACTION</b></color>\r\n\u2022 <b>Storage:</b> You can carry up to <b>3
    items</b>. Swap between them using <b><color=#C0C0C0>[1]</color></b>, <b><color=#C0C0C0>[2]</color></b>,
    and <b><color=#C0C0C0>[3]</color></b>.\r\n\u2022 <b>Pickup:</b> Press <b><color=#C0C0C0>[E]</color></b>
    when looking at an item to add it to your inventory.\r\n\u2022 <b>Drop:</b> Press
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Q]</color></b> to drop the item currently in your hand.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Interact:</b> Watch your <b><color=#C0C0C0>Cursor</color></b>. A text prompt
    will appear underneath it whenever an object can be used or picked up. <b><color=#C0C0C0>[E]</color></b>\r\n\r\n<align=center><b><b><size=120%>MAZE
    OF MEMORIES</size></b></align>\r\n\r\n<voffset=0.5em><b><color=#00FFC0>THE OBJECTIVE</color></b>\r\nFind
    <b><color=#FF00FF>5 Fragments (Purple outline)</color></b> to open the exit.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>THE
    THREAT: OVEREXPOSED</b></color>\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Listen:</color></b>
    Use headphones. Your footsteps can drown out his. Crouch or stand still to pinpoint
    his location.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Sound Trap:</color></b> If footsteps
    are very close, <b>STOP MOVING</b>. Walking or running alerts him instantly.\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>The Scream:</color></b> If he screams, he has spotted you.
    <b>RUN.</b> He is faster than you\u2014reach a <b><color=yellow>Lit Candle</color></b>
    or use your <b>Camera Flash</b>.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Stealth:</color></b>
    Crouching is your best defense. Use it to sneak past him or hide in dark corners.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>DEFENSE
    TOOLS</b></color>\r\n\u2022 <b>Camera:</b> Flash to <b>Stun</b> him for <b>8
    seconds</b> (30s Cooldown). Toggle Viewfinder with <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Right-Click]</color></b>.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Lighter:</b> Provides basic light and is used to ignite candles.\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=yellow>Candles:</color></b> Create <b>Safe Zones</b>. He is stunned
    for <b>3 seconds</b> if he touches the light.\r\n\r\n<i>(Can be found scattered
    around the maze)</i>\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>PERMANENT UPGRADES</b></color>\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Silent Boots:</color></b> Running and walking no longer emits
    noise.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Adrenaline Shot:</color></b> Increases max
    stamina and recovery speed.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Industrial Battery:</color></b>
    Reduces Camera Cooldown to 15 seconds.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Spectral Lens:</color></b>
    Highlights items through the Viewfinder.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>GLOWING OUTLINES</b></color>\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#00C8FF>BLUE:</color></b> Upgrades (Priority #1)\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#FF00FF>PURPLE:</color></b>
    Mission Progress\r\n\u2022 <b><color=yellow>YELLOW:</color></b> Candles & Interactive
    Objects\r\n\u2022 <b><color=white>WHITE:</color></b> General Items\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#FF6400>ORANGE:</color></b> Story Records\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>DANGER
    LEVELS</b></color>\r\n\u2022 <b>1-2 Shards:</b> Faster movement. <b>(Agile)</b>\r\n\u2022
    <b>3 Shards:</b> Extreme speeds. <b>(Lethal)</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>4 Shards:</b> <b>OMNISCIENT.</b>
    He always sees you. <b>KEEP RUNNING.</b>\r\n\r\n<color=red><b>!!! CRITICAL ADVICE
    !!!</b></color>\r\n<b>Collect <color=#00C8FF>BLUE UPGRADES</color> first.</b>
    If you progress too fast without them, you <b>will</b> be caught."
